      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yes, that\u0027s where Mohannad\u0027s error came from yesterday. Sorry, I wasn\u0027t aware we had added androidx.core_core yesterday.\n\nAs to why this happens: FWIU, the problem is that in the current setup (I believe this will change), cronet is pulled in via AndroidManifest uses-library tag. Because of this, no cronet dependency manifest can include a conditional part (i.e. uses-sdk tag with a specific version). See: https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/build/soong/dexpreopt/class_loader_context.go;l\u003d311",
